@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 登录功能时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/登录页\n(Login.vue)" as UI
participant "Pinia\nAuthStore" as Store
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "后端控制器\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl
participant "用户服务\nUserService" as UserSvc
participant "Spring Security\nAuthenticationManager" as AuthMgr
participant "验证码服务\nCaptchaService" as CaptchaSvc
participant "JWT 工具\nJwtUtils" as Jwt
database "UserRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

note over UI
可选：用户点击“显示验证码”，前端请求新的验证码
end note

UI -> Axios: GET /api/auth/captcha/new
Axios -> AuthCtrl: GET /api/auth/captcha/new
AuthCtrl -> CaptchaSvc: generateCaptchaPair() / createCaptchaImage()
CaptchaSvc --> AuthCtrl: { key, imageBase64 }
AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { key, imageBase64, expiresIn }
Axios --> UI: 显示验证码图片，保存 captchaKey

User -> UI: 输入用户名/密码/(验证码)
UI -> Store: handleLogin({ username, password, captcha?, captchaKey? })
Store -> Axios: POST /api/auth/login
note right of Axios
请求体: JSON
{ username, password, captcha?, captchaKey? }
end note
Axios -> AuthCtrl: POST /api/auth/login
AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: login(dto)

group 用户存在性与状态检查
UserSvc -> DB: findByUsername(username)
alt 用户不存在
  UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 抛出 “用户名或密码错误”
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end

alt 用户被禁用/锁定
  UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 抛出 “用户已被禁用/锁定”
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end
end

group 验证码校验策略
alt 连续失败 ≥ 3 次 -> 必填
  UserSvc -> CaptchaSvc: validateCaptcha(key, code)
  alt 验证码错误/过期/缺失
    UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 抛出 “验证码错误或已过期/请先输入验证码”
    AuthCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
    Axios --> UI: 显示错误并提示验证码
    UI -> UI: 自动 refreshCaptcha()
    return
  end
else 提供了验证码（可选校验）
  UserSvc -> CaptchaSvc: validateCaptcha(key, code)
end
end

group 密码认证
alt 密码正确
  UserSvc -> AuthMgr: authenticate(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
  AuthMgr --> UserSvc: Authentication
  UserSvc -> DB: 更新 loginAttempts=0, lastLoginTime=now
  UserSvc -> Jwt: generateToken(UserDetails)
  Jwt --> UserSvc: JWT
  UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: token
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { token, message }
  Axios --> Store: res.token
  Store -> Store: setToken(token) 持久化至 localStorage
  Store -> Store: 等待 100ms 确保写入
  Store -> Axios: GET /api/auth/userinfo\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
  Axios -> AuthCtrl: GET /api/auth/userinfo
  AuthCtrl -> Jwt: extractUsername(token)
  Jwt --> AuthCtrl: username
  AuthCtrl -> DB: findByUsername(username)
  DB --> AuthCtrl: User
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 200 { 用户信息, authorities, role... }
  Axios --> Store: 保存 user / roles
  Store --> UI: 通知登录成功
  UI -> UI: 跳转 '/'
else 密码错误
  UserSvc -> DB: loginAttempts + 1（≥5 则 locked=true）
  DB --> UserSvc: 保存
  UserSvc --> AuthCtrl: 抛出 “用户名或密码错误/账户已被锁定...”
  AuthCtrl --> Axios: 400 { message }
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误\n若包含“验证码”，UI 调用 enableCaptcha() 并刷新
end
end

== 拦截器与安全配置说明 ==
note over Axios
请求拦截器：若存在 token，则为所有请求添加\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
响应拦截器：401 时清理 token 并跳转 /login
end note

note over AuthCtrl
SecurityConfig 允许 /api/auth/** 免鉴权；\n但 /auth/userinfo 仍需前端提供合法 JWT，\n控制器内通过 JwtUtils 解析用户名。
end note

note over Jwt
JWT 过期时间: 24 小时 (application.yml: jwt.expiration=86400000)
end note

note over DB
users 表核心字段：enabled, locked,\nlogin_attempts, last_login_time, role 等
end note

@enduml

